      "message": "I want to propose from strong DH to less strong DH and I found that CURVE_25519\u0027s  security strength is the same as MODP 3072 according to https://groups.google.com/g/strongswan-users/c/2r0FWbEV6po/m/9oUhyxqzAQAJ and https://groups.google.com/g/strongswan-users/c/2r0FWbEV6po/m/MwkiFOeqAQAJ\n\nSince CURVE_25519 key length is shorter than MODP 3072, I put CURVE_25519 between MODP 4096 and MODP 3072",
